    "description": "<p>You may <em>Work on a Project</em> to create a magical trinket. When you do so, spend any number of handfuls of gold up to your Tier, then roll a <strong>d8</strong> for each one spent. Choose an item or consumable from the Loot tables with number equal to or lower than the total result of your roll. You create a temporary copy of the chosen loot and it remains active until your next long rest (or until used, if it is a consumable). Any creature can make a <strong>Reaction Roll (10)</strong> to identify the created loot as a temporary copy.</p>",
